      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MINDGAMES (1) resumes as the horse to beat after winning his only start at Wyong, where he was a well-supported favourite and drove hard late to win by just over a length. Two trials since, including a latest second at Randwick, give him a suitable platform and he's a very progressive talent. Can pick up from where he left off. GLENN'S LEGACY (4) finished a close third at this track two runs back and a forgivable fifth last start after being bumped at the jump. Scratches from a later race to run here which is a good push for his chances. MASTER ZOUS (2) looks an improver after getting back and never featuring at long odds in a tougher race last time. Coming back in grade now is a big tick for his chances, as is the rise in distance. An improved effort is on the cards. OLE MISS (3) jumped favourite on resumption and did enough there. Can improve quickly with that run under her belt. NEFRADITE (8) is next best.",
